  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding symbols:\n\n \n \n\n Symbol\n L\n M\n P\n Q\n \n \n\n Stands for\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nSo checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 17 Q 22 M 18 P 13 L 7 = 473 ⇒ 17 - 22 × 18 + 13 ÷ 7 = 473\n\n⇒ 17 - 22 × 18 + __**13 **____**÷**____** 7**__ = 473\n\n⇒ 17 - __**22 **____**×**____** 18**__ + 1.86 = 473\n\n⇒ __17 + 1.86__ - 396 = 473\n\n⇒ __18.86 - 396__ = 473\n\n⇒ -377.14 ≠ 473 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 12 Q 13 L 15 M 19 P 23 = 96 ⇒ 12 - 13 ÷ 15 × 19 + 23 = 96\n\n⇒ 12 - __**13 **____**÷**____** 15**__ × 19 + 23 = 96\n\n⇒ 12 - __**0.87**____** ×**____** 19**__ + 23 = 96\n\n⇒ __12 + 23__ - 16.53 = 96\n\n⇒ __**35 - 16.53**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 18.47 ≠ 96 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 11 L 34 M 17 P 8 Q 3 = 42/4 ⇒ 11 ÷ 34 × 17 + 8 - 3 = 42/4\n\n ⇒ __**11 ÷**____** 34**__ × 17 + 8 - 3 = __**42/4**__\n\n ⇒ __**0.32**____** ×**____** 17**__ + 8 - 3 = 10.5\n\n⇒ __5.5 + 8__ - 3 = 10.5\n\n⇒__**13.5** - 3__ = 10.5\n\n⇒ 10.5 = 10.5 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) 13 M 64 P 24 L 18 Q 6 = 36 ⇒ 13 × 64 + 24 ÷ 18 - 6 = 36\n\n⇒ 13 × 64 + __**24 **____**÷**____** 18**__ - 6 = 36\n\n⇒ __**13 ×**____** 64**__ + 1.33 - 6 = 36\n\n⇒ __832 + 1.33__ - 6 = 36\n\n⇒ __833.33 - 6__ = 36\n\n⇒ 827.22 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
